              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yeyote ambaye hataitii sheria ya Mungu wenu pia sheria ya mfalme, hakika lazima aadhibiwe kwa kuuawa, kuhamishwa, kunyangʼanywa mali au kufungwa gerezani.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.7.26",
